T04:13:39","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/?page_id=313"},"modified":"2020-04-12T04:13:39","modified_gmt":"2020-04-12T04:13:39","slug":"vision-statement","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/vision-statement\/","title":{"rendered":"VISION STATEMENT"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>WE HAVE A DREAM<\/p>\n<p>[Under Construction]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>WE HAVE A DREAM [Under Construction]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"spay_email":""},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/313"}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=313"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/313\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":314,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/313\/revisions\/314"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=313"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":266,"date":"2019-12-25T20:30:30","date_gmt":"2019-12-25T20:30:30","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/?page_id=266"},"modified":"2023-05-29T05:47:56","modified_gmt":"2023-05-29T05:47:56","slug":"superhero-2","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/superhero-2\/","title":{"rendered":"SuperHero"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>STEP into and OWN your GREATNESS<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\" wp-image-6 alignleft\" src=\"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EDD56A65-882C-4D07-BA51-C83DB9406F2B.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"294\" height=\"409\" srcset=\"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EDD56A65-882C-4D07-BA51-C83DB9406F2B.png 420w, http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EDD56A65-882C-4D07-BA51-C83DB9406F2B-215x300.png 215w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 294px) 100vw, 294px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>In today&#8217;s society, individuals, especially the younger generation, often find themselves on a relentless quest for acceptance and a sense of belonging. Unbeknownst to many, they begin to judge themselves based on their experiences in this pursuit.<\/p>\n<p>For instance, a person might think, &#8220;That situation was awkward&#8230; they called me &#8216;clumsy&#8217;&#8230; they must not like me&#8230; I would be more likable if I&#8230;&#8221;. These internal conversations, among countless others, occur rapidly in our minds, often escaping our notice. Ironically, studies on human interaction have revealed that individuals who accept themselves are more likely to be accepted by others. Furthermore, and perhaps most surprisingly, those who embrace self-acceptance experience less suffering when faced with rejection.<\/p>\n<p>Consider for a moment the vast array of events and choices that have unfolded since the birth of the universe, ultimately leading to your existence in its present form. As Mrs. Which from &#8220;A Wrinkle in Time&#8221; wisely observed, &#8220;Do you realize how many events and choices that had to occur since the birth of the universe, leading to the making of you just exactly the way you are?&#8221;<\/p>\n<p>But how does one arrive at self-acceptance, or even learn to like themselves? Welcome to The Greatness Institute!<\/p>\n<p>At The Greatness Institute, we work closely with our clients, offering individual sessions, pairings, couples counseling, small group gatherings, and even large group workshops. Our primary focus revolves around one essential question: How can you come to accept and embrace your own unique greatness? Allow us to guide you through this transformative journey.<\/p>\n<p>Let&#8217;s begin unraveling the layers and uncovering your true potential!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>STEP into and OWN your GREATNESS In today&#8217;s society, individuals, especially the younger generation, often find themselves on a relentless quest for acceptance and a sense of belonging. Unbeknownst to many, they begin to judge themselves based on their experiences in this pursuit. For instance, a person might think, &#8220;That situation was awkward&#8230; they called &hellip; <\/p>\n<p class=\"link-more\"><a href=\"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/superhero-2\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> &#8220;SuperHero&#8221;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":265,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"spay_email":""},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/266"}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=266"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/266\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":353,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/266\/revisions\/353"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/265"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=266"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":261,"date":"2019-12-24T21:00:27","date_gmt":"2019-12-24T21:00:27","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/walkpono.org\/?page_id=2